idity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Evaluating the Quality and Comparative Validity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#Evaluating the Quality and Comparative Validity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Evaluating the Quality and Comparative Validity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/8B5II4RM","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/34WJJ22W?page=1&annotation=SYH4MSIB","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/34WJJ22W?page=1&annotation=N46EV4J7","line":36}],"metadata":{"Title":"Evaluating the Quality and Comparative Validity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care","Authors":"Xinyi Li, Annabelle Yin, Ha Young Choi, Virginia Chan, Margaret Allman-Farinelli, Juliana Chen","Year":2024,"DOI":"10.3390/nu16152573","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"AI. The top 200 free and paid nutrition-related apps from Australia’s Apple App and Google Play stores were screened (n = 800). Apps were assessed using MARS (quality) and ABACUS (behaviour change potential). Nutritional outputs from manual food logging and AI-enabled food-image recognition apps were compared with food records for Western, Asian, and Recommended diets.","Findings":"Apps with more AI integration demonstrated better functionality, but automatic energy estimations from AI-enabled food image recognition were inaccurate.","Conclusions":"","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1auowuz","at":1774939549790}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/liEvaluatingQualityComparative2024b.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.04829119,-0.02274767,-0.01659282,-0.0274294,-0.00983525,0.02304915,-0.00107126,0.0068366,-0.03925645,0.00583774,-0.01790838,-0.09910903,-0.0015388,0.04490153,0.04320795,-0.02626891,0.06408695,0.01184063,-0.01326552,-0.01785847,0.06799825,-0.02795614,0.00350924,-0.01059442,0.05491551,0.05640887,-0.02941439,-0.03418906,-0.05539357,-0.22415431,0.00221918,-0.05432,0.07347959,-0.02007026,-0.03156976,0.02260158,-0.03532559,0.02357703,-0.08923085,0.00353861,0.06292083,0.00630707,0.04322142,-0.015048,-0.03058688,-0.03007269,-0.03098453,-0.01723354,-0.09007823,0.01739311,0.01726999,-0.01006631,0.01764216,0.0267635,0.0426463,0.05623767,0.02973528,0.07673188,0.09229768,0.09688582,0.03118343,0.06762116,-0.18805163,0.08451474,0.05852278,-0.00124499,-0.08496398,-0.05100217,-0.03568396,-0.05404503,-0.01139271,-0.00259036,0.06549779,0.00071345,0.00692301,0.00826195,0.07929534,-0.04861601,-0.05014643,-0.05665454,-0.02011153,0.06500267,-0.03521773,0.02149961,-0.02170545,0.01664582,-0.02398766,-0.0153078,0.07190258,-0.04688229,0.01837056,-0.00628926,0.01702899,0.01192859,0.00336009,-0.017873,-0.01776006,0.00284198,-0.04895141,0.12239977,-0.00812768,-0.03042037,-0.03052355,-0.03516062,0.05506536,-0.06592797,-0.0014217,-0.02496428,-0.06371271,0.06563836,-0.01006722,0.02266469,0.01304022,0.03760602,-0.00015879,0.05034627,0.09714032,0.00161525,0.05536642,-0.02091476,-0.03616677,0.00427141,0.04214925,-0.03226681,-0.01620752,0.00969814,0.00086397,0.04985907,-0.01980091,-0.01911828,0.08211808,-0.05142182,-0.05821221,-0.02531081,0.01058804,0.00404225,0.01436735,0.01063722,0.00863005,0.06549209,-0.05402811,-0.00818045,0.02795404,-0.07251503,